        "Native category is payments: Chargeblast is a chargeback-prevention API. Source Finance/Data are not in the Rust CATEGORIES allowlist.",
        "Official docs and pinned source agree on https://api.chargeblast.com and the X-API-Key header. Native GETs send Accept only; pinned source also sets content-type: application/json on every request. The upstream user-agent is not sent."
